{
  "name": "awakened-poe-trade",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "vite",
    "lint": "eslint --ext .ts,.vue src",
    "build": "vue-tsc --noEmit && vite build",
    "make-index-files": "node src/assets/make-index-files.mjs",
    "gen-disc-variants": "node ../scripts/gen-disc-variants.mjs",
    "gen-missing-items": "node ../scripts/gen-missing-items.mjs",
    "gen-missing-stat-ids": "node ../scripts/gen-missing-stat-ids.mjs",
    "_comment_regen-data": "順序是硬性的,不是風格。gen-missing-items 會把所有帶 src 標記的列(含 disc 變體)清掉、重放到檔尾;只有 gen-disc-variants 會把變體重新插回基底列後面,而索引依 namespace::refName 去重、查表靠那個相鄰關係。單獨跑第一支會靜默弄丟 100 列占卜寶珠變體。gen-missing-stat-ids 動的是 stats.ndjson 的 trade.ids,與前兩支互不相干,但要排在 make-index-files 之前。",
    "regen-data": "npm run gen-missing-items -- --write && npm run gen-disc-variants -- --write && npm run gen-missing-stat-ids -- --write && npm run make-index-files && npm run verify-datasets",
    "verify-datasets": "node ../scripts/verify-datasets.mjs",
    "_comment_audit-trade-names": "需要網路,所以不併進 regen-data。查的是「送出去交易站認不認得」—— 解析成功不等於查得到,前兩支都看不到這一層。發版前跑。",
    "audit-trade-names": "node ../scripts/audit-trade-names.mjs",
    "_comment_audit-stat-ids": "需要網路,同樣不併進 regen-data。重新推導「有 explicit、缺 implicit」的缺口並向兩個 realm 的 /api/trade/data/stats 核對。新賽季或上游換資料集後跑。",
    "audit-stat-ids": "node ../scripts/gen-missing-stat-ids.mjs --audit",
    "_comment_verify-i18n": "繁中漏翻不會讓建置失敗(fallbackFormat 會安靜退回英文),所以要有這支",
    "verify-i18n": "node ../scripts/verify-i18n.mjs",
    "test": "vitest run --config vitest.config.mts",
    "_comment_test": "解析器回歸網。更新快照:UPDATE_FIXTURES=1 npm test —— **產生的快照必須人工 review 才可 commit**,盲目更新會把回歸網變成永遠是綠的。"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@fortawesome/fontawesome-free": "6.x.x",
    "@sindresorhus/fnv1a": "^3.0.0",
    "@vueuse/core": "^11.0.0",
    "animate.css": "^4.1.1",
    "apexcharts": "^4.0.0",
    "dot-prop": "9.x.x",
    "fast-deep-equal": "^3.1.3",
    "fastest-levenshtein": "^1.0.16",
    "luxon": "3.x.x",
    "neverthrow": "^8.0.0",
    "object-hash": "^3.0.0",
    "sockette": "^2.0.6",
    "tailwindcss": "3.x.x",
    "tippy.js": "^6.2.7",
    "vue": "3.2.37",
    "vue-i18n": "^10.0.0",
    "vue3-apexcharts": "^1.1.1",
    "vuedraggable": "4.1.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/luxon": "^3.0.0",
    "@types/node": "^20.0.0",
    "@types/object-hash": "^3.0.0",
    "@vitejs/plugin-vue": "^4.0.0",
    "@vue/eslint-config-standard-with-typescript": "^9.2.0",
    "@vue/eslint-config-typescript": "^14.7.0",
    "autoprefixer": "^10.0.2",
    "eslint": "^9.39.4",
    "eslint-plugin-vue": "^10.8.0",
    "postcss": "^8.2.14",
    "typescript": "5.6.x",
    "vite": "^5.0.0",
    "vitest": "^2.1.9",
    "vue-tsc": "^2.0.0"
  },
  "optionalDependencies": {
    "@vue/eslint-config-standard-with-typescript": "^9.2.0",
    "@vue/eslint-config-typescript": "^14.7.0",
    "eslint": "^9.0.0",
    "eslint-plugin-vue": "~10.8.0"
  },
  "postcss": {
    "plugins": {
      "tailwindcss/nesting": {},
      "tailwindcss": {},
      "autoprefixer": {}
    }
  },
  "browserslist": [
    "chrome >= 101"
  ]
}
